# Copy to the root of your .NET repository (next to the .sln). `ez` adds it to its checkouts.
# Never send secrets or build output into the build context.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/node_modules/
**/TestResults/
.git/
.github/
**/.env
**/*.env
**/appsettings.*.Local.json
**/secrets.json
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.key
**/Dockerfile*
**/compose*.yml
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/*.Dockerfile
